+   /**
+      MimoMusic patch (dpf-patches/0002).
+      Rounds the automatic scale factor down to a multiple of @a step while the window is larger
+      than its scale factor alone would make it, never below that scale factor. Drawing a layout
+      at a fractional zoom such as 1.37 puts its pixel-aligned lines and glyph edges between
+      physical pixels (soft); at multiples of 0.5 they stay sharp. The window's remaining space
+      goes to the layout as extra logical size. 0, the default, keeps the factor continuous.
+    */
+    void setAutoScaleStep(double step);
